<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL'S ESCELSA H1 NET FALLS VS YR AGO.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL'S ESCELSA H1 NET FALLS VS YR AGO.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned power company Espirito Santo Centrais Eletricas SA (Escelsa) reported the following first-half 1997 results, according to the Sao Paulo bourse.</p>
<p>		    Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>   Net	     40.7 million	    47.9 million</p>
<p>   Net Revs     198.1 million	   160.5 million</p>
<p>   Oper Income   59.1 million	    62.8 million</p>
<p>   Net Worth    825.5 million	    n/a</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
